# Sport lock enforcement — 3 locks

## Layer A — 3 verbal unlocks

No picks/results/card/chart edit for a sport, and no edit to the rest of the
site, unless the owner message contains **UNLOCK** 3 times and names the miss.
Checker fails, chrome, and “fix all sports” are not unlocks.

## Layer B — protected paths

Do not edit a locked sport’s routes, sport-named modules, or that sport’s
branch inside `NHL77FINAL.py` / `team_results_charts.py` /
`templates/includes/game_card_body.html`.

## Layer C — one miss, then lock

One unlocked surface. One named miss. When it is done, lock it again the same
day. Do not leave a sport UNLOCKED overnight.

## Layer D — isolation

A diff while one sport is unlocked must not change a locked sport’s HTML.
